    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its genetic code\nis irregular.\nIt may mutate if\fit is exposed to\nradiation from\nelement STONEs.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its genetic code\nis irregular.\nIt may mutate if\fit is exposed to\nradiation from\nelement STONEs.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its genetic code\nis unstable, so it\ncould evolve in\fa variety of ways.\nThere are only a\nfew alive.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It has the ability\nto alter the com­\nposition of its\fbody to suit its\nsurrounding envi­\nronment.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its irregularly\nconfigured DNA is\naffected by its\fsurroundings. It\nevolves if its en­\nvironment changes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its ability to\nevolve into many\nforms allows it to\fadapt smoothly\nand perfectly to\nany environment.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup\nthat suddenly mutates due to the\nenvironment in which it lives.\fRadiation from various STONES causes\nthis POKéMON to evolve.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
