        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates\ndue to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various\nstones causes this Pokémon to evolve.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates\ndue to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various\nstones causes this Pokémon to evolve.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Possessing an unbalanced and unstable genetic\nmakeup, it conceals many possible evolutions.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Current studies show it can evolve into an\nincredible eight different species of Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The question of why only Eevee has such\nunstable genes has still not been solved.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its genes are easily influenced by its\nsurroundings. Even its face starts to look like\nthat of its Trainer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It can evolve into a variety of forms.\nEevee’s genes are the key to solving\nthe mysteries of Pokémon evolution.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It can evolve into a variety of forms.\nEevee’s genes are the key to solving\nthe mysteries of Pokémon evolution.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It has the ability to alter the composition of its\nbody to suit its surrounding environment.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this\nspecial Pokémon conceals many different\npossible evolutions.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Harbors the potential to evolve into manifold forms.\nWithin Eevee lies the key to the mysteries of Pokémon\nevolution—I'm certain of it.",
